00:41:10.980 --> 00:41:11.420
No.
没有。

958
00:41:11.720 --> 00:41:12.520
Just for yourself.
就留给自己看。

959
00:41:12.800 --> 00:41:14.980
Maybe when I'm like an older lady, I'll do that.
也许等我老了以后会做吧。

960
00:41:15.040 --> 00:41:18.100
I'll just take pictures of flowers and hummingbirds and give it as a gift.
我就拍拍花朵和蜂鸟，然后把它当作礼物送人。

961
00:41:18.300 --> 00:41:19.240
That's what everyone wants.
那可是大家都想要的礼物。

962
00:41:19.480 --> 00:41:21.020
Give it as a gift to yourself.
送给自己当礼物。

963
00:41:21.440 --> 00:41:22.000
All right.
好吧。

964
00:41:22.120 --> 00:41:28.800
Also noted on these lists were the botanical gardens in Singapore, Rio de Janeiro, Norway,
这些名单上还提到了新加坡、里约热内卢、挪威

